      "id": 2,
      "claim": "The Act does not contain a provision that criminalizes the act of chewing gum or the mere possession of gum for personal use.",
      "evidence": "Legal analysis of the Act shows no clause penalizing personal consumption. Peer gptoss120b confirms that the Ministry of Law FAQs state chewing is not an offense if the gum is lawfully possessed (e.g., therapeutic gum).",
